  "notes": "USAGE: {輸送|ゆそう} typically refers to large-scale or commercial transportation, rather than personal travel.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{輸送|ゆそう}する (to transport)\n・{輸送|ゆそう}コスト (transportation cost)\n・{輸送|ゆそう}{手段|しゅだん} (means of transport)\n・{輸送|ゆそう}{業者|ぎょうしゃ} (transport company)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n・{海上|かいじょう}{輸送|ゆそう} (sea transport)\n・{航空|こうくう}{輸送|ゆそう} (air transport)\n・{陸上|りくじょう}{輸送|ゆそう} (land transport)\n\nRELATED:\n・{運送|うんそう} - shipping, delivery\n・{運搬|うんぱん} - conveyance, transport",
